{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Heroic Hop: A New Adventure Begins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and fight your way through deadly traps, tricky platforms, and colossal bosses in this retro-style 2D platformer. Precision and timing are your best allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/bda66b555e6c9aae18d58ec191bbe14a.avif?t=1757213051\" width=1600 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Survive the Castle. Conquer the Unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face lava pits, falling platforms, moving hazards, and hidden secrets in a world full of challenges and surprises. Two mysterious castles await\u2014each with unique themes and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/4a99681be16470a2c92d6c1e8c3a9b51.avif?t=1757213051\" width=1600 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 Face Four Epic Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss comes with unique phases and patterns. Learn their behavior, adapt your strategy, and prove yourself worthy of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/c3226ff7c490e5d5e5ae26c67cdc027d.avif?t=1757213051\" width=1600 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 A Dynamic Life System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lives are limited\u2014but the more you replay, the more you learn. Each retry increases your chances of finding hidden life drops. Every moment becomes a test of resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Core Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight 2D platforming controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky traps, crumbling grounds, and vertical challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent enemies that chase and react to the player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforms that move, rotate, rise and fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo available now!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English, Spanish, Portuguese, German, French, and Italian</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Are you ready to hop into your destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Heroic Hop to your wishlist and take your first step into a new heroic journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764070?t=1757213051","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/a3c3f4c9e349a0ccc629c5c55d27b4598812cb92/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757213051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/87739e021826602fdbb67fc6c8f186e4edfd1892/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757213051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/87739e021826602fdbb67fc6c8f186e4edfd1892/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757213051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3787080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Heroic Hop: A New Adventure Begins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and fight your way through deadly traps, tricky platforms, and colossal bosses in this retro-style 2D platformer. Precision and timing are your best allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" sr