rise and fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo available now!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English, Spanish, Portuguese, German, French, and Italian</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Are you ready to hop into your destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Heroic Hop to your wishlist and take your first step into a new heroic journey!</p>","developers":["Ray C Rivera Morales"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/86f4b90b9ed8d66b69bbaef7dfe919ec77a9ee77/header.jpg?t=1757213051","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257167573,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167573/movie480.mp4?t=1752208907","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167573/movie_max.mp4?t=1752208907"},"name":"languages trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167573/8616ed8f65c4b57fa95f1cae278f416534301f8f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752208907","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167573/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752208907","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167573/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752208907"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257164713,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164713/movie480.mp4?t=1756825700","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164713/movie_max.mp4?t=1756825700"},"name":"gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164713/affde02c404babb43b140199d130b656aa86c3b4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756825700","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164713/movie480_vp9.webm?t=175682570